      "text": "pytest + Vitest + Playwright: behavior and integration. Real-provider runs: observed answers.\nSeparate retrieval coverage, grounding, citations and abstention; valid IDs are not truth.\n25-case release: 6 qualitative issues remain. See the release report for full evidence.\nScope: local, single-user TXT/basic RAG; no authentication, PDF parser or hosted service.",
